# Linting — Spotless and Detekt

## Responsibilities

- **Spotless** (root only): formatting + ktlint lints via **`com.diffplug.spotless`**. Uses pinned **ktlint** and **`io.nlopez.compose.rules:ktlint`** (`customRuleSets`). Targets all `**/*.kt` and `**/*.kts` under the repo with excludes for `**/build/**`, **`**/bin/**`** (generated Kotlin), and `.gradle`.
- **Detekt** (**`dev.detekt`** 2.x, not `io.gitlab.arturbosch.detekt`): static analysis. Shared config: **`config/detekt/detekt.yml`**. Compose-specific rules from **`io.nlopez.compose.rules:detekt`** (`detektPlugins`).

## Where things live

| Item | Location |
|------|----------|
| Spotless + plugin resolution | Root `build.gradle.kts` (`SpotlessExtension`, `alias(libs.plugins.spotless)`, `alias(libs.plugins.detekt).apply(false)`) |
| Versions | `gradle/libs.versions.toml` — `spotless`, `detekt`, `ktlint`, `composeRules`, plugins, `build-plugin-detekt`, `compose-rules-detekt` |
| ktlint / compose editor defaults | **`.editorconfig`** (root) |
| Detekt YAML | **`config/detekt/detekt.yml`** |
| Convention plugin | **`build-logic/.../whitelabel.detekt.gradle.kts`** — applies `dev.detekt`, sets `config`, `source` roots for KMP (`commonMain`, `jvmMain`, `iosMain`, …), `detektPlugins` |
| build-logic classpath | `build-logic/build.gradle.kts` — `compileOnly(libs.build.plugin.detekt)` |

## Applying Detekt in modules

- **`whitelabel.kmp.library`** and **`whitelabel.android.library`** already apply **`id("whitelabel.detekt")` after** Kotlin/Android plugins (order matters for Android).
- **Shell / JVM-only** modules that do not use those conventions: add **`id("whitelabel.detekt")` last** in `plugins { }` (e.g. `androidApp`, `desktopApp`, `brand-parity-tests`).

Do **not** add `detekt-formatting` (would duplicate ktlint vs Spotless).

## Commands

```bash
./gradlew spotlessCheck          # verify formatting + ktlint lints
./gradlew spotlessApply          # auto-fix formatting
./gradlew detekt --continue      # all subprojects; continue after failures
./gradlew spotlessCheck detekt --continue   # same as CI lint job
```

## CI

[`.github/workflows/build-clients.yml`](../../.github/workflows/build-clients.yml) includes a **`lint`** job that runs `spotlessCheck` and `detekt`.

